{
  "case_id": "A-022",
  "category": "auction_price_matching",
  "description": [
    "Auction algorithm for bipartite matching (Bertsekas):\n",
    "- Bidding Phase: Unassigned tasks bid on resource minimizing cost + price, incrementing ",
    "resource price by regret gap plus epsilon and displacing prior occupant.\n",
    "- Epsilon Scaling: Decrease epsilon geometrically across successive auction phases.\n",
    "- Fallback: Revert to LAPJV/shortest augmenting path if the matrix is non-square, cost ",
    "magnitudes are extreme, or auction rows remain unmatched."
  ],
